    "entityType": "properties",
    "entityId": 53867,
    "eventType": "UPDATE"
  }
}

docs {
  Webhook receiver for Impower events. In production this is called by
  Impower's own infrastructure (connection registered with appId=8 in
  POST /v2/connections).

  Behavior:
  - properties/units/contracts/contacts/documents +
    CREATE/UPDATE → triggers a full sync of that entity type
  - …same entity types + DELETE → soft-deletes the local mirror row
  - other entity types (buildings, invoices, messages) → acked-and-ignored
  - duplicate event within 5 min → acked as "duplicate" (Redis-backed dedupe)

  This request is for manual replay/testing only.
}
